{"id":"entrevue","lemma":"entrevue","pos":"noun","rank":4898,"glosses":["interview"],"ipa":"/ɑ̃.tʁə.vy/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/29/Fr-entrevue.ogg/Fr-entrevue.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"entrevues"},"examples":[{"text":"Il nous a accordé une entrevue.","en":"He agreed to give us an interview.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"agreeing"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"J'ai enregistré l'entrevue.","en":"I recorded the interview.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to record for later…","l":"enregistrer"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Je lui ai rappelé son entrevue avec le président.","en":"I reminded him of his interview with the president.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to call again","l":"rappeler"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"president"}]},{"text":"Il nous accorda une entrevue.","en":"He agreed to give us an interview.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to grant","l":"accorder"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ils nous accordèrent une entrevue.","en":"They agreed to give us an interview.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to grant","l":"accorder"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}